1
00:00:03,208 --> 00:00:04,541
Redmond, please!

2
00:00:05,333 --> 00:00:07,333
You share the same blood!

3
00:00:08,083 --> 00:00:09,083
Don't do this!

4
00:00:13,541 --> 00:00:14,708
Severin, just say you're sorry!

5
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:16,250
Forget the wedding!

6
00:00:17,250 --> 00:00:20,291
We’ll run away from Emeraldstone tonight and never come back!

7
00:00:20,333 --> 00:00:22,625
I can't lose you!

8
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:25,041
Mother, don’t be afraid.

9
00:00:26,416 --> 00:00:29,791
No noble on all of Golantis would dare touch me.

10
00:00:31,541 --> 00:00:32,541
Keep bragging.

11
00:00:34,250 --> 00:00:37,000
You clearly don’t know  who the Blade Master is.

12
00:00:38,083 --> 00:00:39,625
When he's done with you,

13
00:00:40,666 --> 00:00:42,666
you'll wish you were never born.

14
00:00:42,666 --> 00:00:44,708
Redmond, let it go.

15
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:48,541
No need to
waste time on him.

16
00:00:53,833 --> 00:00:57,750
The counts and lords are waiting to witness our wedding.

17
00:00:59,875 --> 00:01:00,625
Fine.

18
00:01:01,208 --> 00:01:05,750
If this loser and his dirt-buddies get on their knees,

19
00:01:07,250 --> 00:01:08,458
slap their own faces,

20
00:01:09,666 --> 00:01:11,125
and beg me for mercy...

21
00:01:13,041 --> 00:01:15,125
I might let them crawl out alive.

22
00:01:17,083 --> 00:01:18,500
You heard him, Severin.

23
00:01:20,791 --> 00:01:21,791
Get on your knees.

24
00:01:22,916 --> 00:01:27,791
Even the High King of Golantis cannot make me kneel.

25
00:01:29,666 --> 00:01:32,916
What makes you think this pathetic little insect can?

26
00:01:33,250 --> 00:01:35,583
I tried to save you, Severin!

27
00:01:36,083 --> 00:01:38,500
If you want to commit suicide, fine!

28
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:42,208
But don't drag your mother and these 

29
00:01:42,333 --> 00:01:44,208
innocent idiots down with you.

30
00:01:47,625 --> 00:01:48,916
Forget him, Livia!

31
00:01:50,083 --> 00:01:54,500
Trash like this only learns respect when he sees blood.

32
00:01:57,416 --> 00:02:02,750
Severin, if you insist on digging your own grave,

33
00:02:03,833 --> 00:02:05,000
then so be it.

34
00:02:08,833 --> 00:02:10,041
Severin, please!

35
00:02:11,416 --> 00:02:12,791
Just listen to her!

36
00:02:14,083 --> 00:02:16,625
Apologize to Redmond!

37
00:02:16,833 --> 00:02:18,250
He spit on my people,

38
00:02:21,916 --> 00:02:23,125
and you think I should bend?

39
00:02:27,125 --> 00:02:30,250
Today, I am erasing House Carter.

40
00:02:31,958 --> 00:02:36,083
It’s time for you snobs to feel what absolute power looks like.
